@echo off

@REM Prefer Resource Han Rounded CN over the built-in CJK fonts for the Windows UI.
@REM Covers both the legacy "Segoe UI*" values and the "Segoe UI Variable *" values.
@REM Each value is the pristine Windows default chain with the Resource Han Rounded
@REM entries prepended, so fallbacks for Japanese, Korean and Traditional Chinese
@REM are preserved. Counterpart: reset_cjk-font-fallback.cmd restores the defaults.
@REM
@REM Resource Han Rounded CN ships no Semilight/Semibold faces, so the nearest
@REM available weights are used:
@REM   Semilight -> Resource Han Rounded CN Normal (usWeightClass 350)
@REM   Semibold  -> Resource Han Rounded CN Medium (usWeightClass 500)
@REM
@REM Every linked font is listed twice: once with the 128,96 scaling factors
@REM (used by GDI) and once without them (used by GDI+), same as Windows defaults.

sudo reg add "HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion\FontLink\SystemLink" /v "Segoe UI" /t REG_MULTI_SZ /s "|" /d "RESOURCEHANROUNDEDCN-REGULAR.TTF,Resource Han Rounded CN,128,96|RESOURCEHANROUNDEDCN-REGULAR.TTF,Resource Han Rounded CN|TAHOMA.TTF,Tahoma|MEIRYO.TTC,Meiryo UI,128,96|MEIRYO.TTC,Meiryo UI|MSGOTHIC.TTC,MS UI Gothic|MSJH.TTC,Microsoft JhengHei UI,128,96|MSJH.TTC,Microsoft JhengHei UI|MSYH.TTC,Microsoft YaHei UI,128,96|MSYH.TTC,Microsoft YaHei UI|MALGUN.TTF,Malgun Gothic,128,96|MALGUN.TTF,Malgun Gothic|MINGLIU.TTC,PMingLiU|SIMSUN.TTC,SimSun|GULIM.TTC,Gulim|YUGOTHM.TTC,Yu Gothic UI,128,96|YUGOTHM.TTC,Yu Gothic UI|SEGUISYM.TTF,Segoe UI Symbol" /f
